$ onto $b.$" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275241 1113 #uuid "84ac2ad8-5a67-548f-ab6a-38acdfe05f91" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275241 1145 "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =|\\,a\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =14\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =14\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275243 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275244 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275245 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275246 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275247 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1041 "selection" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275244 13194139533968 true] [17592186275242 1110 #uuid "1d2ee831-5c6a-57a5-8a1a-d691fdf5b8c8" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275243 1034 "-7\\sqrt{2}" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275243 1111 #uuid "97889bf1-7eea-5cf3-9d70-54021674c0c1" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275244 1034 "-7" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275244 1111 #uuid "4adf3938-237f-5051-b4d7-9c9abc6440f6" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275245 1034 "-14" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275245 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275245 1111 #uuid "5d194143-151a-5ff6-9773-d8e4c545a556" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275246 1034 "7" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275246 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275246 1111 #uuid "d97dc640-06ae-585e-ab69-0280e4b6c6bb" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275247 1034 "14" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275247 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275247 1111 #uuid "a9d4b8eb-c7df-5cf0-90ab-