262 1145 "Since $a$ is a nonzero vector, its scalar projection onto another nonzero vector $b$ equals zero only when the vectors are perpendicular. \n\nSo, we must have\n\n$$\na⊥b\\,⟹\\,a\\cdot b=0.\n$$\n\nComputing the dot product, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & ={a}_{x}\\cdot {b}_{x}+{a}_{y}\\cdot {b}_{y}+{a}_{z}\\cdot {b}_{z} \\\\  & =0\\cdot (-2)+(-2)\\cdot x+1\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =2-2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ 2-2x & =0 \\\\ 2x & =2 \\\\ x & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275264 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275265 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275266 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275267 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275268 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1041 "selection" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275265 13194139533968 true] [17592186275263 1110 #uuid "112a0e5a-df0c-52f6-bfd3-c4935b7fa72c" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275264 1034 "2" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275264 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275264 1111 #uuid "118c25ca-ff53-54d8-ab14-2aeeb4551f36" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275265 1034 "1" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275265 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275265 1111 #uuid "ed259811-ee86-5e3f-9239-4e65aac0076e" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275266 1034 "0" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275266 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275266 1111 #uuid "53478fed-80e4-5b24-a4a3-fff977c9872a" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275267 1034 "-1" 13194139533968 true] [17592186275267 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533968 true] [17592186275267 1111 #uuid "f39e126e-efa6-554f-953c-331edb92410b" 13194139533968 true] [175921862